WEBVTT

1
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:42,900
What a coincidence. How about you come to catch fish too?

2
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:46,140
I can see where those things of his came from.

3
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,780
Cast a net to catch fish and trap to catch chickens

4
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:48,940
There are no guarded doorways

5
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:51,580
Seeing it and being able to do it are two different things.

6
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:55,950
These are the only ones growing on that piece of land.

7
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:56,950
All soaked clean

8
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:07,310
What do you mean by knowing how to fish?

9
00:01:07,310 --> 00:01:08,470
How can you know it just by reading it once?

10
00:01:08,670 --> 00:01:11,190
Okay, just say a few words and four taros.

11
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:13,230
Zhou Ting and I, one Chen Jiaoliu and the other

12
00:01:14,930 --> 00:01:16,810
We ran for four hours, two of us divided into one.

13
00:01:16,810 --> 00:01:20,610
The three of you have never been on the ground before, so each of you can go alone, Zhao Ya.

14
00:01:20,890 --> 00:01:23,210
It’s okay if you don’t want to divide it. You can take the taro.

15
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:24,170
How many are yours?

16
00:01:24,530 --> 00:01:26,330
If there is no fire, just make it yourself.
